17:T5c7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there one DSU application for all Italian universities?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The responsible regional body or institution depends on where you study. Use the selected university's current funding page to find the correct authority."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I apply for DSU before university enrolment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Some calls permit an application while admission or enrolment is pending, followed by a later completion deadline. Follow the exact current call."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is ISEE parificato or equivalent economic documentation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It is a process used to assess a household whose income or assets cannot be captured through the standard Italian ISEE. The institution or authorised service specifies the required foreign documents and calculation route."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does DSU cover accommodation automatically?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Accommodation can have its own request, availability, ranking and evidence rules. Read both the scholarship and housing sections of the call."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a consultant guarantee a DSU award?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The competent body assesses the official application and documents. Use its portal and published contacts."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/italy-dsu-scholarships/\",\"name\":\"Italy DSU scholarships: regional benefits and document planning\",\"description\":\"Find the right Italy DSU authority, compare regional routes and prepare financial documents, housing evidence and separate scholarship deadlines.\",\"ur